[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0011","text":"Motion\n"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0010","text":"小美美，后面有没有歪？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0020","text":"嗯……OK\n完美"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0030","text":"——雾子\n还好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0040","text":"咲耶小姐……\n嗯……因为……大家都在……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0060","text":"差不多该准备了\n准备好了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0070","text":"……嗯！\n大家，把手伸出来～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0080","text":"哦……要玩那个啊？\n——……果然还是有点紧张了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0099","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0090","text":"有五个人就没问题——……\n用这个口令来开启我们的故事吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0100","text":"话说回来\n真的要那样来吗——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0110","text":"那当然！\n偶像一言既出驷马难追！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0120","text":"…………\n……我会加油的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0130","text":"大家都是一样的心情哦，小雾——\n好，加油吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0140","text":"是啊，只要大家在一起\n一定能去到任何地方"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0150","text":"嘛……都到这一步了也只能上了吧\n……请多关照——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02010000_99_0160","text":"…………\n走吧……！"}]
